      <section id="contact" class="contact section section-accent">
        <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
              <span class="section-kicker">Contact</span>
              <h2>Need a senior engineer for a similar platform?</h2>
            </div>
            <p>If you are building or scaling an AI product, SaaS platform, marketplace, or custom business system, send the details and I will reply with the best next step.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="row g-4 contact-layout">
            <div class="col-lg-5">
              <div class="contact-panel">
                <h3>Tell me what you are building</h3>
                <p>I work with startups, SaaS teams, and digital businesses that need product thinking, backend depth, and dependable execution.</p>
                <div class="contact-cues">
                  <div><i class="bi bi-clock"></i><span>Usually responds within 24 hours</span></div>
                  <div><i class="bi bi-person-workspace"></i><span>Available for freelance and contract work</span></div>
                  <div><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i><span>Discovery calls available for qualified projects</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-links">
                  <a href="https://calendly.com/ahmadakmal685/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">Book a Call</a>
                  <a href="mailto:ahmadakmal685@gmail.com" class="text-link">ahmadakmal685@gmail.com <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a>
                </div>
                <div class="contact-mini-card">
                  <h4>What happens after you submit?</h4>
                  <p>I review the product scope, follow up with the important technical questions, and suggest the best next step whether that is a call, audit, or delivery plan.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-7">
              <form action="/forms/contact.php" method="post" class="php-email-form contact-form">
                <div class="row g-3">
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <label for="name" class="form-label">Name</label>
                    <input type="text" name="name" class="form-control" id="name" required />
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <label for="email" class="form-label">Email</label>
                    <input type="email" class="form-control" name="email" id="email" required />
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <label for="project-type" class="form-label">Project Type</label>
                    <select class="form-select" name="project_type" id="project-type" required>
                      <option value="" selected disabled>Select project type</option>
                      <option value="saas-development">SaaS Platform Development</option>
                      <option value="ai-platform">AI Platform Development</option>
                      <option value="marketplace">Marketplace Web Application</option>
                      <option value="api-backend">API &amp; Backend Systems</option>
                      <option value="optimization">Performance Optimization</option>
                      <option value="consulting">Technical Consulting</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-md-6">
                    <label for="budget-range" class="form-label">Budget Range</label>
                    <select class="form-select" name="budget_range" id="budget-range" required>
                      <option value="" selected disabled>Select budget range</option>
                      <option value="1000-3000">$1k - $3k</option>
                      <option value="3000-7000">$3k - $7k</option>
                      <option value="7000-15000">$7k - $15k</option>
                      <option value="15000-plus">$15k+</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-12">
                    <label for="message" class="form-label">Message</label>
                    <textarea class="form-control" name="message" rows="7" id="message" placeholder="Share your product, goals, timeline, and the technical help you need." required></textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="loading">Loading</div>
                    <div class="error-message"></div>
                    <div class="sent-message">Your message has been sent. I will get back to you soon.</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="col-12 form-submit">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Start the Conversation</button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </form>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    
  </main>

</MainLayout>
